er</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>McMahon</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Grant</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Pryor</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>VersaStep trocar hernia rate in unclosed fascial defects in bariatric patients</article-title><source>Surg Endosc</source><year>2006</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>1584</fpage><lpage>1586</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16902746</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00464-005-0747-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shinoto</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ochiai</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Suzuki</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Okazumi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Ozaki</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effectiveness of Roux-en-Y reconstruction after distal gastrectomy based on an assessment of biliary kinetics</article-title><source>Surgery Today</source><year>2003</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>169</fpage><lpage>177</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12658381</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s005950300039</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>